# Daily Review Day56

## 오늘의 핵심 문법

### Countable vs. Uncountable Nouns

- many / several / a few + 가산 복수명사
- much / little / a little + 불가산명사
- information, advice, equipment → 불가산명사
- The amount of + 불가산명사 → 단수 동사
- A number of + 가산 복수명사 → 복수 동사

### Examples

- several documents
- much information
- a little time
- useful advice
- The amount of water is increasing.

